# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Hugging Face Complete Ecosystem Rule-Set (HuggingFace.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers Hugging Face Hub, Git LFS & Xet Storage CDNs (cas-bridge),
#              Spaces (*.hf.space), Inference Endpoints, Gradio, Argilla & CLI.
#              Strictly excludes domestic mirrors (e.g., hf-mirror.com).
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,HuggingFace.list,AI-or-Proxy,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Hugging Face Core & Shortener Domains (核心主站、短链与品牌域)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hf.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.tech

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Model Weights, Datasets, Git LFS & Xet Storage CDNs (大模型权重与数据集高速下载网关)
# 极其重要：通过 git-lfs / huggingface-cli / hf_transfer 拉取数十 GB 的 safetensors/gguf 模型时，
#           302 重定向后的真实大文件流量走的是以下 CDN 与 Xet (cas-bridge) 边缘域名！
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xethub.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Hugging Face Spaces, Inference API & Endpoints (在线 AI 应用容器与推理端点)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hf.space
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.space
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,endpoints.huggingface.cloud
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.cloud


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Gradio, Argilla & Acquired Ecosystem (Gradio 交互界面、内网穿透隧道与收购项目)
# 注：本地运行 Gradio 开启 share=True 时依赖 gradio.live 建立 FRP 隧道
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gradio.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gradio.live
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gradio.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,argilla.io

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Process & Client User-Agent Rules (命令行下载工具与 Python SDK 标识匹配)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
USER-AGENT,huggingface-cli*
USER-AGENT,*huggingface_hub*
USER-AGENT,*hf_hub*
USER-AGENT,*hf_transfer*
USER-AGENT,*datasets/*
USER-AGENT,*transformers/*
PROCESS-NAME,huggingface-cli
PROCESS-NAME,hf
